          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pandaŵi jiŵamenyanagajo msilikali jwa ku Iguputo ŵaponyisye mpamba nipo ŵamsomile Yosiya. Yosiya ŵalamwile ŵakutumicila ŵakwe kuti, “Mundyosye malo agano, pakuti mbulele mnope!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.35.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.35.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 35:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ŵakutumicila ŵakwewo ŵamtyosisye Yosiya pa ligeleta lyakwe, nipo ŵamkwesisye mu ligeleta lyakwe, ni ŵajile nawo ku Yelusalemu kuŵawilile. Kweleko ŵasicile m'malembe ga acinangolo ŵakwe, nipo ŵandu wosope ŵa ku Yuda ni ku Yelusalemu ŵamlilile Yosiya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.35.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.35.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 35:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jwakulocesya Yelemiya ŵalembile nyimbo ja malilo pakusaka kumcimbicisya Yosiya. Kutyocela ndaŵi jelejo, acalume ni acakongwe ŵa ku Yuda ŵakusalila ciwa ca Yosiya akusajimba nyimbo jelejo. Nyimboji jikusimanikwa mu buku ja nyimbo sya malilo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.35.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.35.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 35:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Masengo gosope gambone giŵatesile Yosiya, pakukuya yiyalembedwe m'buku ja Malamusi ga AMBUJE, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.35.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.35.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
